  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Near the pit Fang Yuan finds a huge cloud layer thick enough to conceal his ancient sword dragon body. Its defensive Gu formation has no Immortal Gu. When Liu Luo fights, the ground tears open, dozens of vines resembling dragons or pythons drill out, and countless trees expand like jade umbrellas into a huge forest she hides in.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "gu_no_gu",
        "char_liu_luo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After emptying Bone Burial Field, Fang Yuan turns southeast to rob it next, counting on Liu tribe pursuit to waste time at the earlier site.",
      "chapters": [
        1208
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liu-tribe-holding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_bone_burial_field",
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He wants dazzling light Gu among the light Gu there so intense light will form more flowing light fruits for Attitude Gu. Inside are jade light Gu, reflect light Gu, borrow light Gu, return light Gu, colored light Gu such as blue, red, and black light Gu, and dazzling light Gu among others.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liu-tribe-holding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dazzling_light_gu",
        "gu_attitude_gu",
        "gu_borrow_light_gu",
        "gu_black_light_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Luo, nearly two hundred years old with a child’s body, guards the pit and is already alert from Liu Yong’s report. Fang Yuan’s ancient sword dragon tears the defense and gets in. After the fight Liu Luo tells Liu Chang that Liu Guan Yi took away all of the Gu worms inside, not a single one left. Other Liu tribe Gu Immortals scream that the pit was completely robbed.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
